replace(r'Thus reference dispersion modulates the branch contributions without a routing network, while Proposition~\ref{prop:invariance} preserves the base ordering.',r'This closed-form gate adds no router parameters and preserves the base ordering. On Pets L/14, its capacity gains over trained logistic/MLP gates are 7.32 [4.01,10.28]/2.85 [0.80,4.78] points (Supplement V), supporting structural gating without fitting a pseudo-novel router.')
replace('The guarantee is per fixed configuration under independent target class-conditional sampling, with calibration excluded from fitting and tuning.',r'The guarantee is defined on the calibration distribution, per fixed configuration under independent class-conditional sampling. Query-specific reference moments adapt score origins and scales without target-label fitting; Section~\ref{sec:shift} tests this transfer empirically on a natural rendition shift.')
